course: dictionary
lesson: 10245
title: One word, three meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the words around them show which meaning the writer means. The word tom is a good example. It can mean a male cat, the male of some other animals, or a boy's name.
explain: Read this: «By Year 5, Tom is one of two mates he's swapped, though they still say hi in the corridor.» Tom is a boy's name here, because a boy has mates and says hi in a corridor. A capital T at the start of a word is often a clue that it is a name.
explain: Now read this: «Cats hunt by waiting, creeping and pouncing, not by long wild chases like Tom's; farm cats can catch many mice in a year.» Cats, hunting and mice are the clues. Here tom means a male cat, a tomcat.
fact: Tom has three meanings: a male cat, the male of some other animals (such as a turkey), and a boy's name.
fact: A male cat is called a tom or a tomcat. A female cat is a queen, and a baby cat is a kitten.
fact: A tom turkey is a male turkey.
fact: Tom Thumb, Tom Kitten and Tom Sawyer are famous story characters.
fact: To check your meaning, swap it into the sentence. If «Tom» is a boy's name, the sentence should still make sense with a boy's name in that place.
exercise: In nature lessons, a male cat is a tom. What is a female cat called? | A kitten | A tomcat | *A queen | A tom
exercise: «Tom is one of two mates he's swapped.» What kind of word is Tom here? | A male cat | *A boy's name | A tom turkey | A story character
exercise: What is a tom turkey? | *A male turkey | A baby turkey | A turkey that can fly | A female turkey
test: «A boy in New Zealand called Tom kept a pile of cash in his schoolbag.» What is Tom here? | A male cat | *A boy's name | A tom turkey | A story character
test: Which of these means a male cat? | A queen | A turkey | *A tomcat | A kitten
exam: In «Mum says "less screen time on school nights"; Tom hears "never have fun again".», what is Tom? | A tomcat | A male turkey | A male cat | *A boy's name
